{"heading":"Referral from GP","content":"Daniel's GP suggested he come to therapy.","evidence":"My GP suggested I come","scope":"session","category":"Health, Body & Sleep"}
{"heading":"Feeling exhausted","content":"Daniel says he looks and feels exhausted.","evidence":"she's right, I am","scope":"session","category":"Mood & Emotions"}
{"heading":"Project manager role","content":"Daniel works as a project manager at a logistics company.","evidence":"I work as a project manager at a logistics company","scope":"profile","category":"Work & Career"}
{"heading":"Burnout since October","content":"Daniel has been completely burned out since October.","evidence":"I've been completely burned out since October","scope":"profile","category":"Mood & Emotions"}
{"heading":"Lost big client","content":"Daniel's company lost a big client in October.","evidence":"We lost a big client","scope":"profile","category":"Work & Career"}
{"heading":"Doing three people's jobs","content":"Daniel has been doing three people's jobs since the rescue plan.","evidence":"I ended up doing three people's jobs","scope":"profile","category":"Work & Career"}
{"heading":"Long working hours","content":"Daniel is at his desk by seven and answers messages until ten at night.","evidence":"I'm at my desk by seven and I'm still answering messages at ten at night","scope":"profile","category":"Work & Career"}
{"heading":"Sleeping four hours","content":"Daniel sleeps about four hours most nights.","evidence":"Most nights I sleep about four hours","scope":"profile","category":"Health, Body & Sleep"}
{"heading":"Waking at three","content":"Daniel wakes up at three in the morning and cannot fall back asleep.","evidence":"I wake up at three in the morning and can't fall back asleep","scope":"profile","category":"Health, Body & Sleep"}
{"heading":"Racing thoughts at night","content":"Daniel's mind races with work-related thoughts when he wakes at three.","evidence":"Shipping schedules, the client, whether I've forgotten something","scope":"profile","category":"Mood & Emotions"}
{"heading":"Dreading nights","content":"Daniel has started dreading the nights.","evidence":"I've started dreading the nights","scope":"profile","category":"Mood & Emotions"}
{"heading":"Father diagnosed Parkinson's","content":"Daniel's father was diagnosed with Parkinson's disease in the autumn.","evidence":"He was diagnosed with Parkinson's disease in the autumn","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Father's symptoms","content":"Daniel's father has shaking hands, is slower, and gets frustrated.","evidence":"His hands shake, and he's slower, and he gets frustrated","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Father's age","content":"Daniel's father is seventy-three years old.","evidence":"He's seventy-three","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Driving father to Leeds","content":"Daniel drives his father to neurology appointments in Leeds, which is an hour each way.","evidence":"I'm the one who drives him to the hospital in Leeds","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Sister lives in Toronto","content":"Daniel's younger sister Hannah lives in Toronto.","evidence":"My younger sister Hannah lives in Toronto","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Sister calls Sundays","content":"Daniel's sister Hannah calls their father every Sunday.","evidence":"She calls him every Sunday","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Guilt about being tired","content":"Daniel feels guilty for being tired because his father is ill.","evidence":"I feel it's selfish to be tired when he's the one who's ill","scope":"profile","category":"Mood & Emotions"}
{"heading":"Hiding from sister","content":"Daniel tells his sister he is fine when she asks how he is.","evidence":"She asks how I am and I say fine","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Sitting in car park","content":"Daniel sometimes sits in the hospital car park for ten minutes before going in.","evidence":"I sit in the car park at the hospital for ten minutes","scope":"profile","category":"Coping & Strengths"}

{"heading":"GP blood tests normal","content":"Daniel's GP did blood tests and they were all normal.","evidence":"She did blood tests, and they were all normal","scope":"profile","category":"Health, Body & Sleep"}
{"heading":"GP attributed to stress","content":"Daniel's GP said his condition is stress and exhaustion.","evidence":"She said it's stress and exhaustion","scope":"profile","category":"Health, Body & Sleep"}
{"heading":"Girlfriend Claire booked session","content":"Daniel's girlfriend Claire booked the therapy session for him.","evidence":"My girlfriend booked it, to be honest. Claire","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Claire made him tea","content":"Claire makes Daniel tea and does not push him to talk.","evidence":"She makes me tea and doesn't push me to talk","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Claire stopped weekend plans","content":"Claire stopped asking Daniel to go away for the weekend because he always says no.","evidence":"She stopped asking if I want to go away for the weekend, because I always say no","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Work emails prevent rest","content":"Daniel cannot take time off because he would return to two hundred emails.","evidence":"If I'm away I'll come back to two hundred of them","scope":"profile","category":"Work & Career"}
{"heading":"Dad may need him","content":"Daniel worries his dad might need something if he is away.","evidence":"And Dad might need something","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"No proper time off","content":"Daniel cannot remember the last time he was properly off.","evidence":"I can't remember the last time I was properly off","scope":"profile","category":"Work & Career"}
{"heading":"Ran 10km Saturdays","content":"Daniel ran ten kilometres every Saturday morning for six years.","evidence":"I ran. Ten kilometres every Saturday morning. I'd done it for six years","scope":"profile","category":"Coping & Strengths"}
{"heading":"Stopped running two months ago","content":"Daniel stopped running about two months ago because his legs felt like lead.","evidence":"I stopped about two months ago. My legs felt like lead","scope":"profile","category":"Health, Body & Sleep"}
{"heading":"Running was private time","content":"Daniel felt running was the one time in the week nobody could reach him.","evidence":"It was the one time in the week nobody could reach me","scope":"profile","category":"Coping & Strengths"}
{"heading":"Boss Peterson","content":"Daniel's boss is Peterson, who sends emails at eleven at night.","evidence":"Peterson. He's all right as a person, but he sends emails at eleven at night","scope":"profile","category":"Work & Career"}
{"heading":"Answers emails in bed","content":"Daniel answers his boss's emails every time, even when in bed.","evidence":"I answer it. Every time. Even if I'm in bed","scope":"profile","category":"Work & Career"}
{"heading":"Fear of job loss","content":"Daniel is afraid of being let go during a spring restructuring.","evidence":"There's a restructuring in the spring and I'm afraid they'll let me go","scope":"profile","category":"Work & Career"}
{"heading":"Mortgage pressure","content":"Daniel has a mortgage and feels conflicted about being relieved if fired.","evidence":"I have a mortgage","scope":"profile","category":"Work & Career"}
{"heading":"Flat and irritable mood","content":"Daniel reports his moods are flat and irritable.","evidence":"Flat, mostly. And irritable","scope":"session","category":"Mood & Emotions"}
{"heading":"Snapped at colleague","content":"Daniel snapped at a colleague last week over nothing.","evidence":"I snapped at a colleague last week over nothing","scope":"session","category":"Mood & Emotions"}
{"heading":"Sat in toilets ten minutes","content":"Daniel went and sat in the toilets for ten minutes after snapping.","evidence":"went and sat in the toilets for ten minutes","scope":"session","category":"Mood & Emotions"}
{"heading":"Heart going and shaking","content":"Daniel's heart was going and his hands were shaking in the toilets.","evidence":"My heart was going and my hands were shaking","scope":"session","category":"Health, Body & Sleep"}
{"heading":"Thought it was heart attack","content":"Daniel thought for a second it was a heart attack.","evidence":"I thought for a second it was a heart attack","scope":"session","category":"Health, Body & Sleep"}

{"heading":"Previous panic episodes","content":"Daniel has experienced similar episodes a couple of times. One occurred on a train to Manchester.","evidence":"A couple of times. Once on the train to Manchester","scope":"profile","category":"History & Life Events"}
{"heading":"Manchester train platform","content":"During the train episode, Daniel had to get off and stand on the platform.","evidence":"I just had to get off and stand on the platform","scope":"profile","category":"History & Life Events"}
{"heading":"Secrecy about episodes","content":"Daniel has not told anyone about these episodes, including Claire.","evidence":"I haven't told anyone about it, not even Claire","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Fear of losing control","content":"Daniel fears that the episodes mean he is losing it or will not cope.","evidence":"That I'm losing it. That I'm going to end up like, I don't know. Not coping","scope":"profile","category":"Mood & Emotions"}
{"heading":"High coffee intake","content":"Daniel drinks about six cups of coffee a day.","evidence":"I'm on about six cups a day","scope":"profile","category":"Addictions & Habits"}
{"heading":"Evening wine consumption","content":"Daniel drinks two to three glasses of wine in the evenings to switch his head off.","evidence":"I've started having wine in the evenings to switch my head off. Two glasses, sometimes three","scope":"profile","category":"Addictions & Habits"}
{"heading":"Wine and sleep","content":"Daniel feels uneasy about the wine, noting it works for an hour but he still wakes at three.","evidence":"It works for an hour and then I wake at three anyway","scope":"profile","category":"Health, Body & Sleep"}
{"heading":"Perception of therapy","content":"Daniel feels that therapy feels like listing everything wrong with him rather than being useful.","evidence":"It feels like I'm just listing everything that's wrong with me","scope":"session","category":"Self-concept & Identity"}
{"heading":"Relief in sharing","content":"Daniel felt a strange relief saying these things today, like putting down a heavy bag.","evidence":"A bit of a relief, actually. Like putting down a bag I didn't realise I was carrying","scope":"session","category":"Mood & Emotions"}
{"heading":"Sleep as priority","content":"Daniel believes that if he could sleep, he could cope with the rest of his problems.","evidence":"If I could sleep I could probably cope with the rest","scope":"profile","category":"Health, Body & Sleep"}
{"heading":"Grandfather's mining work","content":"Daniel's grandfather worked in the mines in Yorkshire.","evidence":"My grandfather worked in the mines in Yorkshire","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Family stoicism","content":"Daniel's grandfather and father never complained and just got on with it.","evidence":"He never complained about anything, not once. Dad's the same. You just get on with it","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Fear of weakness","content":"Daniel worries his grandfather would think he is weak for being in therapy.","evidence":"I keep thinking he would think I was weak for being here","scope":"profile","category":"Self-concept & Identity"}
{"heading":"Self-perception of tiredness","content":"Daniel believes he is not weak but just very tired.","evidence":"That I'm not weak. I'm just very tired","scope":"profile","category":"Self-concept & Identity"}
{"heading":"Doubt in self-affirmation","content":"Daniel is unsure if he believes that he is not weak yet.","evidence":"I don't know if I believe it yet","scope":"session","category":"Self-concept & Identity"}
{"heading":"Peterson's reaction","content":"Daniel expects Peterson would hate the idea of switching off his phone.","evidence":"Peterson would hate that","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Peterson's indifference","content":"Daniel thinks Peterson would not even notice if he switched off his phone for twenty minutes.","evidence":"Nothing, probably. He wouldn't even notice","scope":"profile","category":"Family & Relationships"}
{"heading":"Phone switch-off plan","content":"Daniel agreed to try switching off his phone at half past nine.","evidence":"Yes. Half past nine, perhaps","scope":"session","category":"Coping & Strengths"}
{"heading":"Sofa tea with Claire","content":"Daniel plans to make the phone switch-off time a thing with Claire, having tea on the sofa.","evidence":"I could make it a thing with Claire. Tea on the sofa","scope":"session","category":"Coping & Strengths"}
{"heading":"Sleep tracking plan","content":"Daniel agreed to write down when he wakes up during the night.","evidence":"I'll write down when I wake up, if I wake up","scope":"session","category":"Coping & Strengths"}
{"heading":"Post-session feeling","content":"Daniel feels tired but lighter and a bit shaky after the session.","evidence":"Tired, but lighter. Is it normal to feel a bit shaky after saying all that?","scope":"session","category":"Mood & Emotions"}

